==Strategy==
All you really need for this stage is [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].

Start off by spamming Cameraman Cats and upgrading your wallet until the first few Owlbrows are defeated. By then, you should have enough money for Bahamut Cat. Just keep spamming Cameraman and Jiangshi from here on out and you'll win.

More meatshields are recommended such as [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] as it can be quite risky with just Cameraman and Jiangshi. Bringing [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and using combos helps too.

Note: If the Owlbrows are not beaten before the St. Pigge the 2nd's arrive, you are almost guaranteed to lose very soon. Sending other meatshields out isn't recommended as your wallet may not be able to sustain them. Instead, upgrade your Cameraman and try again.

